# The Network: PlayStation
#
# Expects a gaming policy.
#
# stun.playstation.net sits in the profile's always-real-ip, so a console's NAT probes reach the gateway by address and never match here.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,playstation.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,playstation.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,playstationnetwork.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sie.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sonyentertainmentnetwork.com
